00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:16.970
We truly are God's people or we truly are doing something good in the world

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:20.200
And I think that's one of the reasons you can get in those mental thought traps.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.040
