and so I got to give it to them that they probably wanted to improve

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:23.440
their personal lives and I don't see being selfish as bad as long as it's not

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:28.300
stepping over and hurting other people to get to those desired ends.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.220
[JODI] I think I'm going to move over here.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:38.480
The "troubled teen" industry is an industry that has secular programs - wilderness boot camps, boarding schools,

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:43.500
rehabilitation centers; the idea is you send your kid to this place to "get fixed".

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:49.860
It's a million dollar industry in Utah alone. And so I don't think when people start these things, it's about the child.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.089
I think it's about the money.

00:09:51.089 --> 00:09:57.899
[CALVIN] I think it's important to clarify: if anybody searches "Mormon fundamentalism" that why I'm not on the exact opposite end

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:02.640
Is that there are different sects of Mormon fundamentalism.

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:07.280
Like if I was part of Warren Jeffs' group, that infamous-- he's in jail for life.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:12.750
Like, I would be clear over there. The people that I know I think they actually believed it.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:16.169
And so my thing is, I think they were sincere.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:23.380
But the ultimate conclusion I came to is just because you're sincere doesn't mean you can't be sincerely wrong.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:27.980
[SHELLEY] When I left, My mind was more with all those people

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:34.820
Who they got an elevated social status, they would travel around the world. They were treated like royalty

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:42.640
And so if they ever left the group or questioned, they would lose this like privileged life they were having.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:47.720
So it wasn't just the leader. It's almost like he exported his own selfishness.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.549
[BENJAMIN] That is such a good point. In my case

00:10:50.549 --> 00:10:55.640
I was I was born into the group and I was raised by my cult leaders and

00:10:55.640 --> 00:11:00.520
used as an example of how to be. And whenever a child did something wrong it was

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:05.340
Compared to me it would Benjy have done this and the child would usually say no

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:11.860
